### [[/blog/hql-0-8-0|HQL 0.8.0: child processes, scripts, HyperMarkDown 0.1.0]]

HQL 0.8.0 starts other programs and reads what they print as typed values,
runs a program as a script, and reads a HyperMarkDown 0.1.0 vault. Running
programs for each, what breaks, and what 0.9.0 brings.

