### [[/blog/ai-oriented-programming-language|From Rust to English to Strange Loops: What Is an AI-Oriented Programming Language?]]

A Reddit question about AI-oriented languages drew answers from Rust and Lean
to English and raw ASTs. Read together, they point past syntax to systems in
which knowledge becomes code and code produces knowledge.

